 "drawing": "Three-door cabinet = lower тумба (3 drawers over 3 doors) + upper 3-door glass showcase; 3 sections (left/centre/right) split by 2 partitions. No dimension lines. Lower: sides 3,4 + partitions 5,6 (681 high) stand on bottom 2 (1349x446, Direkta 7x70); bars 20 (421x70, 2, side sections) and 21 (411x70, centre) between them; top 1 (1349x446) on sides/partitions (eccentrics). Section inner widths from bars: 421 / 411 / 421 -> carcass 4x16+421+411+421 = 1317, so top/bottom 1349 overhang ~16 mm per side. Plinth box 16/19 (1339x70) + 17/18 (368x70) with 6 levelling feet, 8 corner brackets. Lower facade per section: drawer front (425 wide x 199 high) on top, door 22 (425 wide x 476 high) below; drawers: sides 400x150, backs 353x150 (centre) / 363x150 (sides), ДВП bottoms 405x381 (centre) / 405x391 (sides); 3 pairs 400 mm guides. Removable ЛДСП shelves in lower: 7 (415x417, 2) side sections, 8 (415x407) centre. Upper: sides 29,30 and partitions 31,32 (1338x426) stand on top 1; top 28 (1349x446) on them; cornice 35 is ONE part 1431x491 screwed on top 28. Glass doors 33 (1334 high x 425 wide, 3). Glass shelves 36 (418x416, 4 = 2 per side section) and 37 (416x407, 2, centre); LED 6 clips + transformer. Pilasters 23 (22x681) lower, 34 (22x1338) upper, on front edges of the outer sides. Backs ДВП: lower 26 441x714 (2) + 27 427x714 (centre) = 1309 vs 1317; upper 38 1373x441 (2) + 39 1373x427. Scheme p2: 38|39|38 over 26|27|26. Hinges: centre doors on half-overlay K-9.5 (5 = 3 glass door + 2 lower door), side doors on inset K-16 (10 = 3+3 glass, 2+2 lower). Handles 9 (3 drawers + 3 doors + 3 glass doors). Small elevation also shows cornice overhanging and feet under the plinth. front view: pages/turin-0-11-p1.png 396,150,453,239"
